### ====================================================================
### InblackM - Order Tracking & Problem Resolution API (REST Client)
### Base URL: http://localhost:3000
### ====================================================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
@contentType = application/json
@sampleOrderNo = ORD-2587965432159-458

### 1. Health Check
GET {{baseUrl}}/health
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

### ====================================================================
### ส่วนที่ 1: Core API
### ====================================================================

### 2. Create New Order (With Idempotency-Key)
# POST /orders
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Idempotency-Key: IDEM-KEY-{{$timestamp}}

{
  "customerId": "CUST-USER-888",
  "gameId": "ROV",
  "packageId": "ROV-POINTS-500",
  "playerUid": "984512398",
  "amount": 150.00,
  "currency": "THB"
}

### 3. Create Duplicate Order with Same Idempotency-Key (Returns Cached HIT)
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Idempotency-Key: IDEM-KEY-FIXED-SAMPLE-001

{
  "customerId": "CUST-USER-888",
  "gameId": "ROV",
  "packageId": "ROV-POINTS-500",
  "playerUid": "984512398",
  "amount": 150.00,
  "currency": "THB"
}

### 4. Search Order by Order Number (Format ORD-timestamp-random)
# GET /orders/:orderNo
GET {{baseUrl}}/orders/{{sampleOrderNo}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

### 5. Validate Bad Order Format (Expect 400 INVALID_ORDER_FORMAT)
GET {{baseUrl}}/orders/INVALID-FORMAT-999
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

### 6. Search Non-Existent Order (Expect 404 ORDER_NOT_FOUND)
GET {{baseUrl}}/orders/ORD-9999999999999-999
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

### 7. List Active Orders (Current Tab)
# GET /orders?tab=current|history&page=&limit=
GET {{baseUrl}}/orders?tab=current&page=1&limit=10
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

### 8. List Past Completed/Terminal Orders (History Tab)
GET {{baseUrl}}/orders?tab=history&page=1&limit=10
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

### 9. View Order Status Transition Timeline
# GET /orders/:orderNo/timeline
GET {{baseUrl}}/orders/{{sampleOrderNo}}/timeline
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

### 10. Customer Reports Issue
# POST /orders/:orderNo/report-issue
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders/{{sampleOrderNo}}/report-issue
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "customerId": "CUST-001",
  "issueType": "TOP_UP_NOT_RECEIVED",
  "description": "Payment was debited 15 minutes ago but game points are not reflecting."
}

### ====================================================================
### ส่วนที่ 2: เคสปัญหา 5 ข้อ (Problem Cases)
### ====================================================================

### เคส 1 & 2: Bot Worker Claim Order (Atomic Concurrency via SKIP LOCKED)
# POST /bot/claim
POST {{baseUrl}}/bot/claim
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "botId": "BOT-WORKER-ALPHA-01"
}

### เคส 1: Bot Sends Heartbeat Lease Extension
# POST /bot/orders/:orderNo/heartbeat
POST {{baseUrl}}/bot/orders/{{sampleOrderNo}}/heartbeat
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "botId": "BOT-WORKER-ALPHA-01"
}

### Bot Marks Order as Complete
# POST /bot/orders/:orderNo/complete
POST {{baseUrl}}/bot/orders/{{sampleOrderNo}}/complete
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "botId": "BOT-WORKER-ALPHA-01",
  "metadata": {
    "providerTransactionId": "PROV-TX-998811",
    "deliverySpeedMs": 1420
  }
}

### เคส 4: Bot Reports Failure (TRANSIENT vs PERMANENT)
# POST /bot/orders/:orderNo/fail
POST {{baseUrl}}/bot/orders/{{sampleOrderNo}}/fail
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "botId": "BOT-WORKER-ALPHA-01",
  "errorType": "PERMANENT",
  "errorCode": "INVALID_PLAYER_UID",
  "errorMessage": "Player UID not found on official game server."
}

### เคส 4 Self-Healing: Customer Updates UID and Re-queues Order
# POST /orders/:orderNo/retry-uid
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders/{{sampleOrderNo}}/retry-uid
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "newPlayerUid": "CORRECTED-UID-998877"
}

### เคส 3: Bank Payment Webhook (Normal Payment Confirmation)
# POST /webhooks/bank-payment
POST {{baseUrl}}/webhooks/bank-payment
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "eventId": "BANK-EVT-{{$timestamp}}",
  "orderNo": "{{sampleOrderNo}}",
  "amount": 150.00,
  "transactionRef": "TXN-PROMPTPAY-445566"
}

### เคส 3: Duplicate Bank Payment Webhook (Idempotent Handling)
POST {{baseUrl}}/webhooks/bank-payment
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "eventId": "BANK-EVT-DUPLICATE-SAMPLE-001",
  "orderNo": "{{sampleOrderNo}}",
  "amount": 150.00,
  "transactionRef": "TXN-PROMPTPAY-445566"
}

### Customer / Admin Requests Refund
# POST /orders/:orderNo/refund
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders/{{sampleOrderNo}}/refund
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "reason": "Customer changed mind before processing"
}

### Admin Triggers Background Recovery Cycle (Detects Crashes, SLA breaches, Expirations)
# POST /admin/run-recovery-cycle
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/run-recovery-cycle
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

### Admin Views System Alerts
# GET /admin/alerts
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/alerts
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
